 .../ThreadNetworkDirectoryCluster.cpp         | 107 ++++++++++++++++
 .../ThreadNetworkDirectoryCluster.h           |  31 +++++
 .../tests/FakeThreadNetworkDirectoryStorage.h |  10 ++
 .../TestThreadNetworkDirectoryCluster.cpp     | 116 ++++++++++++++++++
